        {"ref": "POK:339", "status": "supports", "note": "Pokorny IEW p. 339-340 (POK_01.txt leaf 353): 'er(ə)d- (ṛ(ə)d-), er(ə)dh- \"hoch; wachsen\". Av. ərəδva- \"hoch\"; lat. arduus \"hoch, steil\"; gall. Arduenna silva, air. ard (*ṛduo-) \"hoch, groß\" ... alb. rit \"wachse\" ... slav. *orstǫ, abg. rastǫ ... \"wachse\".' Exactly the root name, language label and gloss of the chart."},
